    "apigw_short": "Pass. API",
    "nosql_short": "NoSQL",
    "apigw_desc": "<b>Passerelle API.</b> Limite le trafic. Les requ\xEAtes limit\xE9es perdent moins de r\xE9putation que les \xE9checs. <b>Am\xE9liorable (Niveaux 1-3).</b>",
    "nosql_desc": "<b>Base de donn\xE9es NoSQL.</b> Rapide pour READ/WRITE, mais ne peut pas g\xE9rer les requ\xEAtes SEARCH. <b>Am\xE9liorable (Niveaux 1-3).</b>",
    "rate_limit_label": "Limite :",
    "apigw_full": "Passerelle API",
    "nosql_full": "Base de donn\xE9es NoSQL",
    "apigw_desc_long": "Limite le trafic entrant. Lorsque les requ\xEAtes d\xE9passent la limite, l'exc\xE9dent est limit\xE9 avec seulement -0,2 de perte de r\xE9putation (vs -1,0 pour les \xE9checs). Am\xE9liorez les niveaux pour augmenter la limite (20/40/80 RPS).",
    "nosql_desc_long": "Plus rapide et moins cher que SQL pour le trafic READ/WRITE (150ms vs 300ms de traitement). Ne peut pas g\xE9rer les requ\xEAtes SEARCH \u2014 gardez DB SQL pour celles-ci. Am\xE9liorez les niveaux pour une capacit\xE9 plus \xE9lev\xE9e (15/30/50).",
    "apigw_flow": "Flux : Internet \u2192 Pass. API \u2192 ALB ou WAF \u2192 Pass. API \u2192 ALB",
    "nosql_flow": "Flux : Calcul \u2192 NoSQL ou Calcul \u2192 Cache \u2192 NoSQL",
    "tip_apigw": "Ajoutez une passerelle API pour une d\xE9gradation gracieuse pendant les pics de trafic",
    "tip_nosql": "Utilisez NoSQL pour READ/WRITE plus rapide, gardez SQL pour les requ\xEAtes SEARCH",
    "apigw_desc_short": "Limite le trafic ($70)",
    "nosql_desc_short": "DB READ/WRITE rapide ($80)",
    "search": "Search Engine",
    "search_short": "Search",
    "search_engine": "Search Engine",
    "search_desc": "<b>Search Engine.</b> Specialized for SEARCH queries. 3\xD7 faster than SQL DB. <b>Upgradeable (Tiers 1-3).</b>",
    "search_full": "Search Engine",
    "search_desc_long": "Processes SEARCH traffic 3\xD7 faster than SQL DB (100ms vs 300ms). Only accepts SEARCH queries \u2014 other traffic types will fail. Upgrade tiers for higher capacity (12/25/40).",
    "search_flow": "Flow: Compute \u2192 Search Engine or Cache \u2192 Search Engine",
    "search_desc_short": "Fast SEARCH queries ($120)",
    "tip_search_engine": "Add a Search Engine to handle SEARCH queries faster than SQL DB",
    "replica": "Read Replica",
    "replica_short": "Replica",
    "read_replica": "Read Replica",
    "replica_desc": "<b>Read Replica.</b> Offloads READ traffic from master DB. Requires connection to a DB. <b>Upgradeable (Tiers 1-3).</b>",
    "replica_full": "Read Replica",
    "replica_desc_long": "Processes READ traffic faster than master DB (200ms vs 300ms). Must be connected to a SQL DB or NoSQL DB to function. Only accepts READ queries.",
    "replica_flow": "Flow: Compute \u2192 Replica \u2192 DB or Cache \u2192 Replica \u2192 DB",
    "replica_desc_short": "Offloads READ from DB ($100)",
    "tip_read_replica": "Add a Read Replica to offload READ traffic from your overloaded DB",
    "serverless": "Serverless Function",
    "serverless_short": "\u03BB Func",
    "serverless_desc": "<b>Serverless Function.</b> Auto-scales with traffic. Very low upkeep but pays $0.03 per completed request.",
    "serverless_full": "Serverless Function",
    "serverless_desc_long": "Auto-scales with traffic (capacity 30). Very low upkeep ($2/min) but charges $0.03 per completed request. Cheap for bursty / low-volume traffic; expensive at sustained high RPS. Same connection topology as Compute.",
    "serverless_flow": "Flow: ALB / Queue \u2192 Serverless \u2192 Cache / DB / NoSQL / S3",
    "serverless_desc_short": "Pay-per-use compute ($45)",
    "tip_serverless": "Serverless is cheap when idle but pays per request \u2014 pair it with CDN/Cache to keep invocations low",
    "hint_serverless_expensive": "\u{1F4A1} Your Serverless is racking up per-request costs at this RPS. Consider adding a Compute node for cheaper sustained throughput.",
    "hint_search_overload": "\u{1F4A1} Your DB is overloaded with SEARCH queries. Consider adding a Search Engine!",
    "hint_read_overload": "\u{1F4A1} Too many READs hitting your DB. A Read Replica can offload read traffic!",
    "hint_replica_write": "\u{1F4A1} Les r\xE9plicas sont en lecture seule ! Gardez Compute connect\xE9 \xE0 la BD principale \u2014 le trafic WRITE n'a nulle part o\xF9 aller.",
    "hint_no_waf": "\u{1F4A1} Malicious traffic is getting through! Add a Firewall to block attacks.",
    "hint_no_cache": "\u{1F4A1} Many requests are cacheable. A Memory Cache would reduce DB load!",
    "hint_compute_overload": "\u{1F4A1} Vos n\u0153uds de Calcul sont d\xE9bord\xE9s. Une File d'attente absorbe les rafales \u2014 mais elle n'ajoute aucune capacit\xE9 : sous charge soutenue, elle transforme les requ\xEAtes perdues en r\xE9ponses lentes. Pour la capacit\xE9, faites \xE9voluer le Calcul.",
    "hint_no_cdn": "\u{1F4A1} High static traffic! A CDN can serve it without hitting your servers.",
